🇺🇸🇮🇷 Washington Post Claims "Clash" Between Trump-Hegseth is a Fiction, But to What End?

▪️Neither US President Donald Trump nor US Secretary of Defense Pete Hegseth are in charge of anything - both demonstrate profound ignorance and incompetence daily;

▪️Both are merely figureheads serving the role of loud distractions and/or scapegoats/excuses;

▪️The US is almost certainly suffering from a well-known shortage of munitions, but has settled on an achievable strategy of controlled demolition of West Asia's energy exports as a means of cutting exports to China & the rest of Asia - it must pretend to seek dealing with Iran, create excuses why it cannot, all while in reality constantly degrade West Asian energy exports, and slowly deepen the economic crisis across the rest of Asia;
